# Source screenshots for the user manual.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. The supplied .docx files contain unredacted
# screenshots carrying a named customer organisation, staff names and a work
# email address, so they must not be committed — the published images under
# static/img/manual/ are the redacted output, and those are the only versions
# that belong here.
#
# tools/build_manual_images.py reads these files. To re-run it, obtain the
# .docx from the shared drive and put them back in this folder.
/ScreenshotsForUserManual

